                                  The Urchin
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

[N], [D], [Get All], [Nw], [U], [S], [W], [W], [W], [W], [N]

At this point, you will have to go and find the urchin.  He's usually around
in the basements somewhere. Once you find him, you have to [Show Hand To
Urchin], [Get Cutter]. Then you have to get to the Basement and continue with
the solve.

